## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.5 Preview
- **Short description:** Meituan’s LongCat 2.5 Preview is described as a hosted, API-only preview model (1M context, image input) for autonomous coding agents, with a free OpenCode Zen slot and no open weights or published benchmarks.
- **Provider / access:** LongCat platform / OpenCode Zen (`opencode/longcat-2.5-preview-free`). Local metadata lists `noFreeId` and notes limited-time pricing.
- **Release / knowledge:** Preview/changelog context referenced in local metadata. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated.
- **IDs:** `longcat-2.5-preview`, `longcat-2.5-preview-free`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (1M); 131,072 max output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.30/$1.20 per 1M in/out, $0.006 cached (limited-time price) per metadata; free Zen slot available.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary/undisclosed. No open weights or model card with architecture details in reviewed sources.

